WEBVTT

00:03:28.433 --> 00:03:30.727
hivyo kwa miaka mingi, nilikataa kuoga.

00:03:31.251 --> 00:03:35.219
ninakuhakikishia hali yangu ya usafi
iko kwa viwango kwa sasa, hata hivyo.

00:03:35.243 --> 00:03:36.876
(Kicheko)

00:03:38.487 --> 00:03:42.880
Ilinibidi kufanya kazi kubwa kufika hapa,
na wazazi wangu --

00:03:42.904 --> 00:03:47.533
mambo kidogo yalikwenda mrama
nilipodhalilishwa kingono na mtu wa rika langu,

00:03:47.557 --> 00:03:52.357
na juu ya mambo yote,ilifanya
hali mbaya kuwa mbaya zaidi.

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:58.833
Nikapaswa kusafiri maili 2000
ndani ya nchi kupata matibabu,

00:03:58.857 --> 00:04:02.531
lakini siku chache baada ya
kupewa dawa mapya,